docs {
  # Update Expense (Creator or Owner)

  - **Method** `PUT`
  - **Endpoint** `/api/v1/groups/:groupID/expenses/:expenseID`
  - **Auth** Bearer access token

  ## Description

  Replaces the title and allocation of an existing expense. Every required field must be supplied, even if unchanged. The mutation saves the revised split and attachment links together. For a partial edit, use `PATCH`.

  An active original creator or the current group owner can make this request while the group is `ACTIVE`. Ownership changes do not change the recorded payer. Example IDs are illustrative. Use IDs from your own group.

  ## Enum values

  | Field | Values | Meaning |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `expense_type` | `NORMAL`, `PREMIUM` | Existing classification. Creation sets NORMAL. |
  | `split_type` | `EQUAL`, `EXACT`, `PERCENTAGE`, `WEIGHTED` | Case-sensitive allocation mode. |
  | `group status` | `ACTIVE`, `SETTLING`, `CLOSED` | Only ACTIVE permits expense changes. |

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`). |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json`. Keep the body within 1 MiB. |

  ### Path parameters
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive signed 64-bit group ID. Bruno variable `expenseGroupId`. |
  | `expenseID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive expense ID in the addressed group. Bruno variable `expenseId`. |

  ### Query parameters
  This endpoint has no query parameters.

  ### Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `title` | `string` | Yes | 1–200 characters. Leading and trailing space is trimmed. A blank trimmed title is invalid. |
  | `description` | `string \| null` | No | Omit or send null to clear. A string replaces the existing description. |
  | `total_amount_toman` | `integer` | Yes | Positive signed 64-bit whole-toman amount. |
  | `split_type` | `string` | Yes | One of the four case-sensitive modes above. |
  | `occurred_at` | `RFC 3339 timestamp \| null` | No | Omit or send null to preserve. A timestamp replaces the current date. |
  | `shares` | `array` | Yes | At least one share, with unique membership IDs. |
  | `shares[].member_id` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group membership ID. Current and former members qualify. The payer may be included. |
  | `shares[].value` | `number \| null` | Depends | Rules depend on split_type. The EQUAL mode allows omission or null. |
  | `attachment_ids` | `integer[] \| null` | No | Omit or null preserves linked receipts. [] detaches them all. A non-empty array is the complete desired set. |

  ### Split modes

  | split_type | Value for each share | Total rule |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `EQUAL` | Omit `value`, send null, or send the integer 1. | All shares have equal weight. |
  | `EXACT` | Non-negative integer toman. | Values must sum to `total_amount_toman`. |
  | `PERCENTAGE` | A JSON number from 0 through 100, with increments of 0.01. | Values must sum to exactly 100. |
  | `WEIGHTED` | Positive integer weight. | Share is proportional to weight divided by the sum of weights. |

  Send numeric split values as ordinary JSON numbers. The number parser rejects quoted values and exponent notation for `value`. The server floors each proportional share, then assigns remaining toman to the largest fractional remainders, breaking ties by ascending `member_id`. The resulting amounts sum to the expense total.

  ### Example replacement

  This replaces the split with 25 and 75 toman, clears the description and keeps the original occurrence time and attachments.

  ```json
  {
    "title": "Dinner (corrected)",
    "total_amount_toman": 100,
    "split_type": "EXACT",
    "shares": [
      {
        "member_id": 30,
        "value": 25
      },
      {
        "member_id": 31,
        "value": 75
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1101,
      "group_id": 10,
      "created_by_member_id": 30,
      "paid_by_member_id": 30,
      "title": "Dinner (corrected)",
      "description": null,
      "total_amount_toman": 100,
      "expense_type": "NORMAL",
      "split_type": "EXACT",
      "occurred_at": "2026-11-20T10:00:00Z",
      "created_at": "2026-11-20T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-20T10:05:00Z",
      "is_frozen": false,
      "can_edit": true,
      "can_delete": true,
      "shares": [
        {
          "member_id": 30,
          "value": 25,
          "share_amount_toman": 25
        },
        {
          "member_id": 31,
          "value": 75,
          "share_amount_toman": 75
        }
      ],
      "my_share_amount_toman": 25,
      "attachment_ids": [
        1201
      ],
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": 1201,
          "original_filename": "receipt.pdf",
          "mime_type": "application/pdf",
          "file_size_bytes": 28413,
          "access_url": "https://storage.example.com/signed/receipt.pdf"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Response fields

  | Field | Type | Meaning |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `id` | `integer` | Expense ID, used in expenseID. |
  | `group_id` | `integer` | Parent group. |
  | `created_by_member_id` | `integer` | Original creator's group membership ID. |
  | `paid_by_member_id` | `integer` | Original payer's group membership ID. Equal to created_by_member_id. |
  | `title` | `string` | Stored display title. |
  | `description` | `string \| null` | Optional details. Null when absent or cleared. |
  | `total_amount_toman` | `integer` | Total expense in toman. |
  | `expense_type` | `string` | Current expense classification. |
  | `split_type` | `string` | Allocation mode. |
  | `occurred_at` | `RFC 3339 timestamp \| null` | When the expense occurred. Older rows can have null. |
  | `created_at` | `RFC 3339 timestamp` | When the expense was registered. |
  | `updated_at` | `RFC 3339 timestamp` | Last update to the expense record. |
  | `is_frozen` | `boolean` | True in SETTLING and CLOSED. |
  | `can_edit` | `boolean` | True for the creator or current owner while ACTIVE. |
  | `can_delete` | `boolean` | True for the creator or current owner while ACTIVE. |
  | `shares` | `array` | Saved shares, in ascending member_id order. Legacy expenses can return an empty array. |
  | `shares[].member_id` | `integer` | Current or former group membership ID. |
  | `shares[].value` | `number` | Configured split input. A percentage in PERCENTAGE, weight in WEIGHTED, toman in EXACT or 1 in EQUAL. |
  | `shares[].share_amount_toman` | `integer` | Final allocated whole-toman amount. |
  | `my_share_amount_toman` | `integer` | The caller's saved share, or 0 when none. Includes the payer's own share when allocated. |
  | `attachment_ids` | `integer[]` | IDs of attached receipts ordered by ID. |
  | `attachments` | `array` | Receipt details, ordered by ID. Empty when none. |
  | `attachments[].id` | `integer` | Attachment ID. |
  | `attachments[].original_filename` | `string \| null` | Original display filename. |
  | `attachments[].mime_type` | `string \| null` | Stored MIME type. |
  | `attachments[].file_size_bytes` | `integer \| null` | Stored length in bytes. |
  | `attachments[].access_url` | `string \| null` | Signed download URL when available. Refresh the API response for a new URL after expiration. |

  ## Errors

  | HTTP | code | error | When it happens |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_INVALID_SPLIT` | `provide valid split values for the selected split type` | A value violates the split mode. |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_SPLIT_TOTAL_MISMATCH` | `exact shares must sum to total_amount_toman and percentages must sum to 100` | EXACT amounts do not sum to total_amount_toman or percentages do not sum to 100. |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_DUPLICATE_MEMBERS` | `shares must not contain duplicate member IDs` | At least one member_id was supplied more than once. |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_DUPLICATE_ATTACHMENTS` | `attachment_ids must not contain duplicate IDs` | The attachment_ids array repeats a receipt ID. |
  | 400 | `INVALID_FILE_TYPE` | `file type or format is not supported` | A supplied file is not an EXPENSE_RECEIPT attachment. |
  | 400 | `BAD_REQUEST` | `bad request payload or parameters` | Invalid ID, malformed JSON, invalid field type, invalid title/date/amount, or a body that exceeds the 1 MiB JSON limit. Required fields and split_type are checked during JSON binding. |
  | 401 | `MISSING_TOKEN` | `authorization token is missing` | Missing Authorization header or invalid Bearer header format. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_INVALID` | `authorization token is invalid` | Invalid access token, including use of a refresh token in its place. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_EXPIRED` | `authorization token has expired` | Access token expired. Refresh it or sign in again. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_REVOKED` | `authorization token has been revoked` | Access token is blacklisted. |
  | 403 | `USER_INACTIVE` | `user account is deactivated` | Caller account is inactive. |
  | 403 | `EXPENSE_FORBIDDEN` | `only active group members can access expenses` | The caller lacks active membership in the group. |
  | 403 | `EXPENSE_EDITOR_REQUIRED` | `only the expense creator or current group owner can edit or delete this expense` | The caller is neither the original creator nor the current group owner. |
  | 403 | `ATTACHMENT_FORBIDDEN` | `you do not have permission to access or modify this attachment` | Receipt belongs to another expense or group, or the unlinked receipt was uploaded by another user. |
  | 404 | `USER_NOT_FOUND` | `user not found` | Caller account is missing or soft-deleted. |
  | 404 | `GROUP_NOT_FOUND` | `group not found` | Group is missing or soft-deleted. |
  | 404 | `EXPENSE_NOT_FOUND` | `expense not found` | The expense is missing, soft-deleted or belongs to a different group. |
  | 404 | `EXPENSE_PARTICIPANT_NOT_FOUND` | `a selected participant does not belong to this group's current or former members` | A selected membership does not belong to this group. |
  | 404 | `ATTACHMENT_NOT_FOUND` | `attachment not found` | A supplied receipt is missing or soft-deleted. |
  | 409 | `EXPENSE_GROUP_INACTIVE` | `expenses cannot be changed while the group is inactive` | The group is SETTLING or CLOSED. Expense writes are frozen. |
  | 500 | `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` | `an internal server error occurred` | Database, transaction or token verification dependency failed. |
  | 503 | `STORAGE_UNAVAILABLE` | `storage service is temporarily unavailable` | Required attachment URL signing failed. |

  ### `400 EXPENSE_SPLIT_TOTAL_MISMATCH` example

  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "code": "EXPENSE_SPLIT_TOTAL_MISMATCH",
    "error": "exact shares must sum to total_amount_toman and percentages must sum to 100"
  }
  ```
}
